  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNECA Handel 2010-12</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNECA Trade 2010-12</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r UNECA:s st&#xf6;djande arbete till Afrikanska Unionens Kommission och  den afrikanska agendan liksom de regionala ekonomiska gemenskaperna   (RECs). Totalt 120 milj SEK till utvalda underprogram av ECA&apos;s        Business Plan f&#xf6;r 2010-2012 (Varav dessa 50 milj SEK till             underprogrammen f&#xf6;r ekonomisk utveckling, handel och regional         integration). St&#xf6;det ges under en JFA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNECA supports the African Union Commission and the African agenda as well as the regional economic communities (RECs). The Sida UNECA      contribution amounts to SEK 120 million to selected sub-programs of   the ECA 2010-2012 Business Plan (out of which SEK 50 million are      ear-marked for economic development, trade and regional integration). The support is provided through a JFA.</narrative>
  </description>
